    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "영작문제 2"
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "다음 문제를 영작해주세요."
    },
    {
      "type": "sentences",
      "items": [
        {
          "n": "134",
          "text": "You didn't learn it from an old man like me, did you?"
        },
        {
          "n": "135",
          "text": "You told me everything else(every other thing), didn't you?"
        },
        {
          "n": "136",
          "text": "Time is up, isn't it?"
        },
        {
          "n": "137",
          "text": "Weren't we really having a good time?"
        },
        {
          "n": "138",
          "text": "You will take me out some other time, won't you?"
        },
        {
          "n": "139",
          "text": "What are you doing here?"
        },
        {
          "n": "140",
          "text": "Why can't you wait till tomorrow?"
        },
        {
          "n": "141",
          "text": "Where did you get this?"
        },
        {
          "n": "142",
          "text": "You are not going into surgery tomorrow, are you?"
        },
        {
          "n": "143",
          "text": "He was not formally arraigned."
        },
        {
          "n": "144",
          "text": "Will the United States undoubtedly(without a doubt) face future terrorist threats?"
        },
        {
          "n": "145",
          "text": "When did our forces defeat adversaries(enemies)?"
        },
        {
          "n": "146",
          "text": "Haven't they yet emerged?"
        },
        {
          "n": "147",
          "text": "They will not challenge us."
        },
        {
          "n": "148",
          "text": "So did you grow up around here?"
        },
        {
          "n": "149",
          "text": "What was that(it) like then?"
        },
        {
          "n": "150",
          "text": "What do you think?"
        },
        {
          "n": "151",
          "text": "Why don't you say that(it) again?"
        },
        {
          "n": "152",
          "text": "Do you still see(meet) all of them?"
        }
      ]
    },
